{
 "recap": {
  "file": "recap.mp3",
  "hash": "781a1e58fef8952c",
  "text": "「勇者と魔王」の録音が終わりました。黒川先生は「悪くない」と言いました。",
  "voice": "Schedar",
  "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview"
 },
 "s1-01": {
  "file": "s1-01.mp3",
  "hash": "9088436e90ab4c2b",
  "text": "新しい台本を書いてきました。今度はミステリーです。",
  "voice": "Leda",
  "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview"
 },
 "s1-02": {
  "file": "s1-02.mp3",
  "hash": "46f34ae48b307bc7",
  "text": "『放課後の名探偵』…。探偵はわたしね。まあ、当たり前じゃない。",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-03": {
  "file": "s1-03.mp3",
  "hash": "599d4e1923d04d4a",
  "text": "えー、俺は助手かよ！刑事がよかったぜ。",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-04": {
  "file": "s1-04.mp3",
  "hash": "e87620ace80a70c4",
  "text": "わたしは目撃者ですねぇ。…あれぇ？冷蔵庫のプリンが、ありません。",
  "voice": "Achernar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-05": {
  "file": "s1-05.mp3",
  "hash": "b639701685077e0f",
  "text": "プリン？あとで調べてみるわ。まずは録音よ。",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-06": {
  "file": "s1-06.mp3",
  "hash": "2056f8d204777b0c",
  "text": "……ぐう……。",
  "voice": "Umbriel",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-01": {
  "file": "s2-01.mp3",
  "hash": "8b43e7ee56b652a8",
  "text": "夕方の職員室。校長先生のたんじょうびケーキが、消えました…。",
  "voice": "Achernar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-02": {
  "file": "s2-02.mp3",
  "hash": "2fcbddc21b74ad7e",
  "text": "名探偵！大変です！犯人は、きっと隣のクラスのやつです！",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-03": {
  "file": "s2-03.mp3",
  "hash": "893fc52e8d83b272",
  "text": "落ち着きなさい、助手くん。あんたは答えを出すのが早すぎるのよ。",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-04": {
  "file": "s2-04.mp3",
  "hash": "fe202ade715911cd",
  "text": "そこのお嬢さん。あなたが見たことを、話してみなさい。",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-05": {
  "file": "s2-05.mp3",
  "hash": "d6b1cf9101126d65",
  "text": "はいぃ…。五時ごろ、窓の外を、白くて小さいものが走っていきましたぁ。",
  "voice": "Achernar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-06": {
  "file": "s2-06.mp3",
  "hash": "273e74b95eeafcf9",
  "text": "白いもの！？おばけですよ！名探偵、早く逃げましょう！",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-07": {
  "file": "s2-07.mp3",
  "hash": "86e2e30d5f41ade9",
  "text": "おばけなんて、いないわ。…見なさい。この窓、少しあいているわね。",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-08": {
  "file": "s2-08.mp3",
  "hash": "f9498cb309e4b629",
  "text": "助手くん、床をよく見てみなさい。なにがある？",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-09": {
  "file": "s2-09.mp3",
  "hash": "b7ad0087a3f0018a",
  "text": "えっと…小さい足跡と…白い毛が、少しあります！",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-10": {
  "file": "s2-10.mp3",
  "hash": "503a9966149e5840",
  "text": "ふふん。この謎の答えは、もう床の上にあるわ。",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-11": {
  "file": "s2-11.mp3",
  "hash": "82f64db788fa662e",
  "text": "犯人は人間じゃない。窓から入ってきた、白い猫よ！",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-12": {
  "file": "s2-12.mp3",
  "hash": "f94f62f775446941",
  "text": "にゃーん。",
  "voice": "Achernar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-13": {
  "file": "s2-13.mp3",
  "hash": "ad0cbce6919b3269",
  "text": "さすが名探偵！…でも、猫にこのケーキは大きすぎませんか？",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-14": {
  "file": "s2-14.mp3",
  "hash": "15c8f64bcb64bc59",
  "text": "そ、それは…次回の謎よ！",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-01": {
  "file": "s3-01.mp3",
  "hash": "840429cade6dde06",
  "text": "はい、カットですぅ。でも、わたしのプリンの謎は、まだですよぉ。",
  "voice": "Achernar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-02": {
  "file": "s3-02.mp3",
  "hash": "163d60d320dfbc88",
  "text": "あの…黒川先生の口の横に、なにか黄色いものが付いています。",
  "voice": "Leda",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-03": {
  "file": "s3-03.mp3",
  "hash": "fc5525fa636db0b5",
  "text": "本当だ！これ、プリンだぜ！",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-04": {
  "file": "s3-04.mp3",
  "hash": "db354909bccaa3f9",
  "text": "犯人は…先生だったのね！",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-05": {
  "file": "s3-05.mp3",
  "hash": "9664f91c9c2472fc",
  "text": "…あー。冷蔵庫にあったから、食べてみた。…ちょっと甘すぎたな。",
  "voice": "Umbriel",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-06": {
  "file": "s3-06.mp3",
  "hash": "118a67c2ff313031",
  "text": "先生ぇ、それ、わたしのプリンですぅ…。",
  "voice": "Achernar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-07": {
  "file": "s3-07.mp3",
  "hash": "fde39bbd5c63c263",
  "text": "…本当の名探偵は、あんただったわね、シャオユー。",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-08": {
  "file": "s3-08.mp3",
  "hash": "52f3f03ae48a9041",
  "text": "えへへ。次は、先生に新しいプリンを買ってもらいましょう。",
  "voice": "Leda",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "g1-ex1": {
  "file": "g1-ex1.mp3",
  "hash": "e9f722edaa2ca194",
  "text": "この服、ちょっと着てみてもいいですか。",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "g1-ex2": {
  "file": "g1-ex2.mp3",
  "hash": "d45897aa1c1cb507",
  "text": "にほんのラーメンを、一度食べてみたいです。",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "g2-ex1": {
  "file": "g2-ex1.mp3",
  "hash": "8baa1597309f5654",
  "text": "このカレーはからすぎて、食べられません。",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "g2-ex2": {
  "file": "g2-ex2.mp3",
  "hash": "83c58250ffdd5386",
  "text": "昨日、ゲームをしすぎて、目が痛いです。",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
